  "name": "Executive",
  "description": "The executive function code resides in fixed block zero of a control module. It selects the output mode of the light emitting diodes (LED) on the front panel of the control module. The LEDs display the status of the control module or an internal memory location. The executive function code has 15 output blocks numbered zero through 14. Fixed blocks zero through nine are fixed values.",
  "description_lines": [
    "The executive function code resides in fixed block zero of a",
    "control module. It selects the output mode of the light emitting",
    "diodes (LED) on the front panel of the control module. The",
    "LEDs display the status of the control module or an internal",
    "memory location. The executive function code has 15 output",
    "blocks numbered zero through 14. Fixed blocks zero through",
    "nine are fixed values."
  ],
